{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51237","headline":"自臯亭至吴门吊二大护法 · 慧净","name":"自臯亭至吴门吊二大护法","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病耳蚊过似走雷，杖行犹怯步难回。\n一舠白水牵愁断，两束黄香拭泪开。\n了悟世缘容直往，徘徊梦影或双来。\n远公自看莲花漏，无复宗雷过讲台。\n（《古今图书集成·神异典》二一一《居士部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧净","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51237.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51237","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}